    <briefdescription>
<para>Brute-force in-memory vector index. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Suitable for unit tests, small datasets (≤ 100 k vectors), and as a reference implementation. Linear scan O(n · dim) per query.</para>
<para>Thread-safe: all public methods are protected by a single <computeroutput>std::mutex</computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
